BT 1 0 0 1 0 88.5 Tm /F1 9.5 Tf 14 TL (The homepage introduces NRI University with a welcome message, tagline, and an Apply Now button. The About) Tj T* (section gives a short description of the college. The Departments section displays programmes such as CSE, CSM,) Tj T* (ECE, and EEE, while the Courses section lists B.Tech, M.Tech, and MBA. The Faculty section highlights) Tj T* (experienced teachers, academic mentors, and technical trainers. The Admission Procedure section shows the basic) Tj T* (steps for applying. Campus Facilities lists the library, computer labs, sports, and transport. College Events presents) Tj T* (cultural, technical, and sports events. The Contact section provides the college name and location, and the footer) Tj T* (closes the page with the university identity and tagline.) Tj T* ET
